362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (The comparison shows that ROUGE and BERTScore are poor proxies for legal-summary quality in this task. They can overestimate incorrect summaries and underestimate good, differently worded summaries. Therefore, automatic metrics should be used as supporting measures, not as a replacement for manual evaluation, especially when factual and legal correctness are critical.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
