373 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (These cases show that automatic metrics alone are unreliable for evaluating Hindi legal summarization. ROUGE and BERTScore can reward lexical or semantic similarity while overlooking hallucinated entities, incorrect legal terminology, factual inversions, and even catastrophic mistranslations. Conversely, summaries with better legal terminology and reasoning may receive lower automatic scores. Manual evaluation is therefore essential for identifying errors that matter most in legal settings.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 106 0 R
/Pg 21 0 R
/A [711 0 R 0]
/K [4]
>>
endobj
